### HF-70 — Metas de redução: CRUD + comparativo + fechamento (MET-04/05/06/07). Base: http://localhost:8081/api/v1
@base = http://localhost:8081/api/v1
@user = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@category = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-0000000000c1

### Cenário: criar meta (201) — snapshot previous_amount capturado do hf-transaction-service; null se upstream fora (MET-04)
POST {{base}}/goals/reduction
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "{{user}}",
  "category_id": "{{category}}",
  "competence": "2026-07",
  "target_amount": "400.00"
}

### Cenário: meta duplicada para (user, categoria, competência) — MET-04 (409 GOAL_ALREADY_EXISTS)
POST {{base}}/goals/reduction
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "{{user}}",
  "category_id": "{{category}}",
  "competence": "2026-07",
  "target_amount": "300.00"
}

### Cenário: body sem campos obrigatórios (400 VALIDATION_ERROR)
POST {{base}}/goals/reduction
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "{{user}}"
}

### Cenário: user_id inválido (400 INVALID_USER_ID)
POST {{base}}/goals/reduction
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "not-a-uuid",
  "category_id": "{{category}}",
  "competence": "2026-07",
  "target_amount": "400.00"
}

### Cenário: target_amount ≤ 0 — MET-04 (400 INVALID_TARGET_AMOUNT)
POST {{base}}/goals/reduction
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "{{user}}",
  "category_id": "{{category}}",
  "competence": "2026-07",
  "target_amount": "-10.00"
}

### Cenário: competência fora de YYYY-MM — MET-04 (400 INVALID_COMPETENCE)
POST {{base}}/goals/reduction
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "{{user}}",
  "category_id": "{{category}}",
  "competence": "07/2026",
  "target_amount": "400.00"
}

### Cenário: listar metas da competência (200; [] sem metas)
GET {{base}}/goals/reduction?user_id={{user}}&competence=2026-07

### Cenário: listar com user_id inválido (400 INVALID_USER_ID)
GET {{base}}/goals/reduction?user_id=abc&competence=2026-07

### Cenário: atualizar target_amount — único campo editável (200)
# Substitua :id pelo id retornado na criação.
PUT {{base}}/goals/reduction/00000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000e001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "target_amount": "350.00"
}

### Cenário: atualizar meta inexistente (404 GOAL_NOT_FOUND)
PUT {{base}}/goals/reduction/99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "target_amount": "350.00"
}

### Cenário: comparativo mensal — MET-05/07 (200; variation/on_track/progress; campos null com upstream fora)
GET {{base}}/goals/reduction/comparison?user_id={{user}}&competence=2026-07

### Cenário: comparativo com competência inválida (400 INVALID_COMPETENCE)
GET {{base}}/goals/reduction/comparison?user_id={{user}}&competence=2026-13

### Cenário: fechamento do mês — MET-06 (200 {closed: n}; metas com upstream fora são puladas)
POST {{base}}/goals/reduction/close-month
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "competence": "2026-07"
}

### Cenário: fechamento sem competence (400 VALIDATION_ERROR)
POST {{base}}/goals/reduction/close-month
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Cenário: excluir meta — soft delete (204)
DELETE {{base}}/goals/reduction/00000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000e001

### Cenário: excluir meta inexistente (404 GOAL_NOT_FOUND)
DELETE {{base}}/goals/reduction/99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999
